{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】海關搗破3個私煙儲存倉庫，檢獲59萬支私煙，拘捕3人。</p>\n<p>行動中，兩名26歲及37歲內地男子及一名67歲本地女子被捕。</p>\n<p>海關周二及周三分別在上水及深水埗截停涉案人士，在他們身上發現私煙，進一步搜查後，再在地舖、唐樓及劏房單位檢獲共59萬支私煙，市值265萬元，應課稅值195萬元。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:09.464423+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:21:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:33.397629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:33.397629+00:00","content_hash":"dfd6cbe0c5fd8c09a803824d8cea9613f8fdca468342d91748f78f517597bb71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}